eply STOP to unsubscribe. Text HELP for support or\nclick here\n.\nPrivacy Policy\nDisclaimer: Submission of this request does not guarantee that a letter of support will be issued. All requests are subject to review, and the final decision to provide a letter of support rests solely with the representative and the relevant governing bodies.\nSubmit\nSign Up to Receive Legislative Email Updates\nKeep up-to-date on the latest legislative and community news. Your email address will be used strictly for legislative purposes.\nEmail*\nZIP Code\nSubscribe",
