    "raw_text": "Bashline to Join McCormick at Legislative Forum in Tionesta\nJune 30, 2026\nWHAT\n:\tRep. Josh Bashline (R-Clarion/Armstrong) will be joining U.S. Sen. Dave McCormick (R-PA) to hear from constituents regarding state-level issues; learn how they can collaborate to bring critical dollars back to the 63rd District; address concerns from local agriculture leaders; and tour Wolfs Corner Fairgrounds to assess the economic impact of community fairs in the region.\nWHEN\n:\tThursday, July 2, at 1:30 p.m.\nWHERE\n:\tWolfs Corner Fairgrounds, 119 Fairground Lane, Tionesta, PA, 16353.\nMedia contact: Nate Temple, 717.260.6396, ntemple@pahousegop.com\nShare\nSign Up to Receive Legislative Email Updates\nKeep up-to-date on the latest legislative and community news. Your email address will be used strictly for legislative purposes.\nEmail*\nZIP Code\nSubscribe",
